      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "64f1f3c9a712e40936485d2a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "In the latest VRChat Beta, which introduces Unity 2022, there is a noticeable and concerning drop in frame rates when accessing the quick menu or any menu in the application. This drop in performance is severe, causing frame rates to plummet from a stable 40-50 fps down to a mere 10 fps for a few seconds. What makes matters worse is that this lag adversely affects the play space mover functionality, making it difficult for other programs to keep up due to the persistent lag.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1342] In Unity 2022 Beta Frames Drop badly when opening menu.",
